<#f0f000>Movelist :</>

<#f0f000>Information:</>
This is Taiga from Toradora, Though She does NOT play like Dengeki!

Taiga has access to a unique form of Awakening which grants her the 
ability to utilize Awakening Points (AP) and Spirit Points (SP) to enhance 
her capabilities in battle. Awakening also has the added benefit of 
increasing the damage of all your attacks by 10%.

Awakening is accessed through the use of AP and can only be activated 
if you have sufficient AP. Once enough AP has been gained, you can press 
"A" to activate Awakening mode which will immediately consume 50 AP 
upon activation (Comboable). 

There is no time limit on the mode, Rather it depletes after each hit.

Every time you enter Awakening you will gain 1 SP which is represented
by the segmented meter above the AP gauge.

Taiga can stock up to a maximum of 3 SP at any give time. 


<#f0f000>Normals:</>
[Awakening]								^X
(50 AP bar needed!! Theres a 3 second Cooldown after deactivated)

[Demon Thrust] 							_D _F ^A/^B/^C
Can Move left or right after activation!!! 
If awakened will cause a wall slam!!!

[Tiger Upper] 							_F _D _DF ^A/^B/^C
If Awakened Damage opponent is luanched higher.

[RYUJI!!]                               _D _D ^A/^B/^C
Only Usable If Assist gauge is full!
If awakened or a hit by a proj Ryuji will instantly attack!

[Sled Ram]								_D _DB _B ^A/^B/^C 
Also Usable in the air!

[Demonic Chaos] 							_D _F ^A+^B
Can Move left or right after activation!!! 
If awakened it's a single strike and is chargable!!!

[Tiger Raid] 							_F _D _DF ^A+^B
1 SP can be used to cancel it if it connects first.

[Sled Crasher]								_D _DB _B ^A+^B
Also Usable in the air!

<#ff0000>Supers:</>

[Curbstomp Symphony] 						_D _F _D _F ^A/^B/^C 
(3 Levels or 350 AP needed!!)

[T&D Connection]							_D _B _D _B ^A/^B/^C 
(3 Levels or 350 AP needed!!)









